OL,3,GNEWSAHospital admits full
OL,4,Aresponsibility for 24 failures that led
OL,5,Ato toddler's death
OL,6,
OL,7,FA hospital trust has taken full
OL,8,Fresponsibility for 24 failures that led
OL,9,Fto the death of a 21-month-old.
OL,11,FEleanor Hazel Aldred-Owen died at
OL,12,FLiverpool's Alder Hey Hospital on 2
OL,13,FOctober 2023 - a coroner concluded she
OL,14,Fdied as a result of misadventure,
OL,15,Fcontributed to by neglect.
OL,17,FShe had routine surgery for
OL,18,Fcraniosynostosis, a birth defect
OL,19,Faffecting the skull, but an abnormal
OL,20,Fchest X-ray was not flagged.
